criptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-08T16:39:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T16:39:55Z","body":"收到，这次的包很完整，详情页数据都齐了，感谢配合！\n\nUCAS 的适配已经完成，周次按教务详情页里的真实周次导入，带洞、单双周这些情况都处理了。v1.0.52 正在收尾，发布后在这里说一声。\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lingion/sleepy/issues/comments/5588601279/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lingion/sleepy/issues/comments/5594009579","html_url":"https://github.com/lingion/sleepy/issues/18#issuecomment-5594009579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lingion/sleepy/issues/18","id":5594009579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOS8keYs8AAAABTW3P6w","user":{"login":"lingion","id":165679819,"node_id":"U_kgDOCeASyw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165679819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion","html_url":"https://github.com/lingion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lingion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T00:44:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T00:44:35Z","body":"v1.0.52 发布了:https://github.com/lingion/sleepy/releases/tag/v1.0.52\n\nUCAS 周次按详情页的真实周次导入,带洞、单双周都按教务数据走,就在这一版里。装上后哪门课的周次不对,直接在这里说。\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lingion/sleepy/issues/comments/5594009579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lingion/sleepy/issues/comments/5594558789","html_url":"https://github.com/lingion/sleepy/issues/18#issuecomment-5594558789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lingion/sleepy/issues/18","id":5594558789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOS8keYs8AAAABTXYxRQ","user":{"login":"damifan3","id":118594746,"node_id":"U_kgDOBxGcug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118594746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/damifan3","html_url":"https://github.com/damifan3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damifan3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damifan3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damifan3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damifan3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damifan3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damifan3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damifan3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damifan3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damifan3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T01:51:53Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T01:52:42Z","body":"教务直连时发生错误。\n浏览器中第一次进入https://xkgo.ucas.ac.cn:3000/course/personSchedule 会提示登录失败\n\n<img width=\"1147\" height=\"383\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54a56bb0-947e-4241-b16d-e750af8bfb15\" />\n\n点击请重新登录，可跳转sep账号登录，https://sep.ucas.ac.cn/?loginFrom=/appStore\n但是sleepy中点击请重新登录直接报错：{\"code\":401,\"msg\":\"未登录或会话已过期\",\"toUrl\":\"/\"}","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lingion/sleepy/issues/comments/5594558789/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]